WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.920
(upbeat synthesizer music)

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.480
- [Mike] A lot of people
may think it's surprising

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.288
that somewhere such as Dubai

00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:12.211
in the middle of the Middle
East would offer hockey,

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.447
but people wanna come and play with us.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.864
They're playing for the love of the game.

00:00:22.353 --> 00:00:24.484
(techno music)

00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:25.692
My name is Mike Freeson,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:30.687
and the team I play on is
the Dubai Mighty Camels.

00:00:30.687 --> 00:00:33.641
To come to a place where
you only can play indoors,

00:00:33.641 --> 00:00:35.961
and even then it sometimes is too hot,

00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:37.787
the air conditioning can't keep up,

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.932
it's quite a bit different
than my experience back home,

00:00:40.932 --> 00:00:42.265
that's for sure.

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:45.200
Grew up in rural Alberta, Canada,

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.470
so it was basically in
your blood to play hockey.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.694
Like every kid in Canada, we
all dream to play pro someday,

00:00:53.694 --> 00:00:56.861
and now in Dubai, I'm able to do that.

00:00:58.944 --> 00:01:01.306
(horn blows)

00:01:01.306 --> 00:01:04.306
(synthesizer music)

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:10.706
EHL stands for Emirates Hockey
League, and it was created

00:01:10.706 --> 00:01:14.203
just to get the best
hockey players in the UAE

00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:15.815
into a competitive league

00:01:15.815 --> 00:01:18.994
to build and develop their local players.

00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:19.827
(whistle blows)

00:01:19.827 --> 00:01:22.187
We have six teams in the league this year.

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:24.258
We've had players that have played pro,

00:01:24.258 --> 00:01:26.437
they've played high college
level in the States,

00:01:26.437 --> 00:01:29.463
high college level,
university level, in Canada.

00:01:29.463 --> 00:01:31.903
We have players that played pro in Europe.

00:01:31.903 --> 00:01:33.653
All different levels.

00:01:35.257 --> 00:01:39.007
(synthesizer music)

00:01:39.007 --> 00:01:42.261
In Dubai, we don't have
a local team of Emiratis,

00:01:42.261 --> 00:01:46.784
but we play against the locals
in Abu Dhabi and in Al Ain.

00:01:46.784 --> 00:01:50.095
Playing in Dubai Mall exposes
it to a lot more people.

00:01:50.095 --> 00:01:52.767
It really brings more people to the game.

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:54.787
You know, when you're in Dubai
Mall and you're playing

00:01:54.787 --> 00:01:56.960
and you're surrounded by a thousand people,

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.194
who 60% of them probably
have never seen it before,

00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:01.682
it's a special feeling.

00:02:01.682 --> 00:02:04.682
It's an honor to be able to do that.

00:02:05.804 --> 00:02:09.054
Obviously, I think it's the
best sport in the world.

00:02:09.054 --> 00:02:11.985
It's great to see that you're making

00:02:11.985 --> 00:02:14.486
some sort of contribution
to expanding the sport

00:02:14.486 --> 00:02:16.208
and promoting it in parts of the world

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:19.208
where it's not natural to be played.

